--
-- tracker_items --- the in-app backlog: what is being worked on, who it is
-- with, and where it has got to. ONE permission (mod:/tracker) grants both
-- the page and the right to add and edit, because everyone who can see it
-- can change it. Granted to ADMIN only here; anyone else is added by hand
-- on Roles & Permissions.
--
-- GENERATED by scripts/build-apply-bundles.mjs — do not edit by hand.
-- Edit the migrations below and re-run the generator.
--
-- Carries, in order:
--   0143_tracker.sql
--   0144_tracker_seed_backlog.sql
--   0146_tracker_air_liquide_id.sql
